{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Quietus Euphony is</i>\u00a0a 2D top-down <strong>narrative RPG</strong>.\u00a0 The player has joined a once-renowned band reeling from the suspicious death of a key member. Now isolated in a remote hotel, you must investigate the crime, build trust with the other band members, and decode the meaning behind Okami\u2019s final song \u2014 before the killer strikes again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE WHO YOU WILL TRUST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the trust of other band members by spending time with them, collect information through branching dialogue, and engage in activities with them to unlock more of the hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096170/extras/b5f285012f7b9d49a5c81737ba8cd653.poster.avif?t=1761086530\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096170/extras/b5f285012f7b9d49a5c81737ba8cd653.webm?t=1761086530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096170/extras/b5f285012f7b9d49a5c81737ba8cd653.mp4?t=1761086530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIND THE HIDDEN SONG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the hotel for the pieces of the song that will reveal the truth, avoid mysterious figures, and find out what secrets the darkness is hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096170/extras/9730e99114680db6866a80108e3fa6f7.poster.avif?t=1761086530\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096170/extras/9730e99114680db6866a80108e3fa6f7.webm?t=1761086530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096170/extras/9730e99114680db6866a80108e3fa6f7.mp4?t=1761086530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4096170?t=1761086530","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4096170?t=1761086530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096170/c1d42202b9a1f00f098c0ade65b0dbf7e8bc632b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761086530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096170/c1d42202b9a1f00f098c0ade65b0dbf7e8bc632b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761086530","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The story and setting are dark in theme. It involves a death under suspicious circumstances that the player must investigate."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Quietus Euphony is</i>\u00a0a 2D top-down <strong>narrative RPG</strong>.\u00a0 The player has joined a once-renowned band reeling from the suspicious death of a key member. Now isolated in a remote hotel, you must investigate the crime, build trust with the other band members, and decode the meaning behind Okami\u2019s final song \u2014 before the killer strikes again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE WHO YOU WILL TRUST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the trust of other band members by spending time with them, collect information through branching dialogue, and engage in activities with them to unlock more of the hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_